WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The promise starts before the audio.
A title tells you what to expect.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Researchers can test that expectation against
a credible alternative.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Some studies find belief matters.
Others find effects that differ from placebo.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Neither result proves that a particular track
improves your concentration.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try twelve minutes with a simple timer.
Write down what you completed.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the sources and check the offer.
Decide what extra structure is worth.
